    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@$\\mathbb{K}$,Type),LA.Field($\\mathbb{K}$),Type.annotation(@M,Type),LA.VectorSpace(M,$\\mathbb{K}$)),def(LinearMap.BilinForm($\\mathbb{K}$,M),,$\\mathrm{BilinForm}\\ \\mathbb{K}\\ M = \\mathrm{BilinMap}\\ \\mathbb{K}\\ M\\ \\mathbb{K}$))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "$M$ 上的双线性型是取值于 $\\mathbb{K}$ 的同一源空间双线性映射，即 `LinearMap.BilinForm 𝕂 M = LinearMap.BilinMap 𝕂 M 𝕂`；对称、交错等性质作为附加谓词研究。显式参数为 $\\mathbb{K}\\ M$。",
          "en": "A bilinear form on $M$ is a same-source bilinear map with values in $\\mathbb{K}$, i.e. `LinearMap.BilinForm 𝕂 M = LinearMap.BilinMap 𝕂 M 𝕂`; symmetry and alternation are extra predicates. Explicit parameters are $\\mathbb{K}\\ M$."
        }
      }
